---
title: Cosmetic syntax that has no effect on execution
---
graph TB
  %% a comment on its own line
  classDef start fill:#eef,stroke:#33f
  add[Add numbers]:::start ---> double("Double it"); double --> finish((End))
  subgraph group [Just a box]
    direction LR
    double
  end
  style add fill:#f9f
  linkStyle 0 stroke:#333
  class double highlighted
